#: scenario:scenario_733932F8_99D6_4C79_AA66_A85288D2ABBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92c9931e6e555d3dc119fafa5ab5a84a4be66f0794047aaa190e3abf59d94acf
#. default-sha256: a57cdf8b5a9ca691525dffeb9f2f72f6a645c50c742aea137310c1cc0cf1dded
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_733932F8_99D6_4C79_AA66_A85288D2ABBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The room with the fireplace was always kept in pristine "
"condition so they could entertain guests at any time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫La stanza con il caminetto veniva tenuta sempre in "
"perfette condizioni, così da poter intrattenere gli ospiti in qualsiasi momento."

#: scenario:scenario_93990DC2_AEFA_4178_8839_92F278F31293
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3034d9389613e13d9a3133254dcbbdf03e023d7831efae5a41c3ffae69f8e675
#. default-sha256: f574f7548f29b3fad5c015a3a2ad2e0a82d9f1b2f06bf1ce2d20172aae6c345f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_93990DC2_AEFA_4178_8839_92F278F31293"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Walls colorfully decorated with tapestries and stained-glass windows gave testament to their "
"great fortune."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pareti decorate con arazzi e finestre in vetro colorato testimoniavano la loro grande "
"fortuna."

#: scenario:scenario_C484908D_52F5_4594_95F3_954AECDEE522
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e6412d21854eada65786362a03cc3d3bf3f9004fe3a59bdec58a815b374e116
#. default-sha256: 3da002cd40dad2186839619fc663ccbb2e4fae98cf5ee09a8d0f468a05a2ffca
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C484908D_52F5_4594_95F3_954AECDEE522"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The servants’ first assignment every morning was to clean this room."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il primo incarico dei domestici era di pulire quella stanza ogni mattina."

#: scenario:scenario_18E382B8_1ECB_4769_8786_65433954308B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fe35f8a747558ee66c822c57c5e21029148dfb0ee40f82dda1e22a135e492a2
#. default-sha256: 33ae1fe89210934daaa097cd31ffcee05d0a13d18624cd160bcd56a6dc854d25
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_18E382B8_1ECB_4769_8786_65433954308B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pitchers, silver plates, and silverware were polished to a shine so they could be proudly "
"put to use at a moment’s notice."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Brocche, piatti d’argento ed altra argenteria venivano lucidati fino a brillare, affinché "
"potessero essere sfoggiati con orgoglio al momento opportuno."

#: scenario:scenario_EB3B5C9C_0AF1_4DC4_82C6_D50D1E9A46AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61e400263b239078f538c07d2c6953a74523ecc6c8623f3972afddb398ce30c5
#. default-sha256: 02a9cb73df532f973093432c66252d458a3be71b1147d64ffe97cfb4a2a55dd8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EB3B5C9C_0AF1_4DC4_82C6_D50D1E9A46AC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And for events like their daughter’s birthday, the room served an even more important role."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E per eventi come il compleanno della figlia, la stanza aveva un ruolo ancora più importante."

#: scenario:scenario_D740EFB7_CD99_4401_8898_8761EF8F9271
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c69942724525b29f2fee28e4692aa55dba0e6a0345f288fd46f0e624a0aec86f
#. default-sha256: 4680671ac1c99ecf398093c121276de31533886ac9b0f92e7f075985da05a3d7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D740EFB7_CD99_4401_8898_8761EF8F9271"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The tables’ tops were removable, so they had ordered new tabletops with designs made "
"especially for this occasion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I piani dei tavoli erano rimovibili, perciò avevano ordinato nuovi ripiani decorati, "
"realizzati appositamente per quella occasione."

#: scenario:scenario_B7CAB2CD_4031_4E6C_A8AF_D0F1F486DDCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0af4b74a2c7100645f6afc12dd4b65287c054f5e252de0aef0efb36d03cc0a0
#. default-sha256: bee3d64e36a1ab1ffd12a64742cd9cd70e7efe027f642f9f9ebf85d2e9d1a002
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B7CAB2CD_4031_4E6C_A8AF_D0F1F486DDCB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And once the banquet had drawn to a close, tables speckled with half-empty wine glasses and "
"leftover candied fruits were moved off to the side to make room for—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫of course—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"the festivities."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E una volta concluso il banchetto, i tavoli disseminati di bicchieri di vino semivuoti e di "
"resti di frutta candita venivano spostati ai lati della sala per fare spazio alle danze."

#: scenario:scenario_E4783BD9_F5CF_4FB4_8F58_D3C1BFC940DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2906a3e1eeed2c628a6f7f09b1a1db6f96819cb17c42eccd61f0dc86e5b1e112
#. default-sha256: 14382fc8a5c2880e9cd90239accdf34aa1de3f1f922bdf816531150d67b4ce3b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E4783BD9_F5CF_4FB4_8F58_D3C1BFC940DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Good evening, Lady Nellie!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫You’re looking particularly lovely "
"today."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Buonasera, Lady Nellie!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Siete particolarmente adorabile oggi."

#: scenario:scenario_BBFA0DBB_0B1F_4D9E_B286_7E65ADF5CEB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b7708741a67b459a9ee9e9dada008b9ec06eb6aa61ab90d2a316da84944530f
#. default-sha256: f7d73201fbb275806d059c0f17447ae9c3fe7b0a32afb282986471c1970de2b3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BBFA0DBB_0B1F_4D9E_B286_7E65ADF5CEB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nellie, I had these jewels cut just for you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Lady Nellie, ho fatto intagliare questi gioielli solo per voi."

#: scenario:scenario_836794CF_AE93_4D51_A19A_80F37CC09A07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac682a668136131dd144bb2b3e88c91f8dc80019f6697ba38fc58cc747a7ef56
#. default-sha256: 99b8207661c71103a46bb6cd9327794154818a95d7e18f0e9f7b13bac1a04f2a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_836794CF_AE93_4D51_A19A_80F37CC09A07"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You’ll let me have this dance, won’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mi concedete questo ballo?"

