"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫............⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Haaaaaaaahh..."

#: scenario:scenario_1ADB677C_2191_42BE_8E2F_65AE3D6B334A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e03e1582c4fe70ac23af2b52ff8cde6d09a2b44e047d91d8ee3ae0c08594237
#. default-sha256: db564a584e79e91e622447b55579baba0a0f0674a6fb5afdcc487c6d468a3a21
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1ADB677C_2191_42BE_8E2F_65AE3D6B334A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What’s the matter, Nellie?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You look exhausted."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Qual è il problema, Nellie?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Sembri esausta."

#: scenario:scenario_25B59912_86D9_4430_A5F0_DB07F0529EDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6581bbb0638fabf76e726d9229ec387c47a64c6ea594ff999a67028625208c53
#. default-sha256: fed250f308762a973092845b8ddfc5aa9c80f83b2486545be4d76f1c7aa9748c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_25B59912_86D9_4430_A5F0_DB07F0529EDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫These are pretty good.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Want one? ⟪k:5⟫I know you like sweets.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"They’re apples candied in rock sugar, I think."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Che buone. Ne vuoi una?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫So che ti piacciono i dolci.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Credo siano "
"delle mele candite."

#: scenario:scenario_DA8B5329_49DB_4C6C_923F_FEDFDFE8DDA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67e4e01a97b3908dbb5ff9709d47e540e497e503f21743c3d4a47d2fd82f1703
#. default-sha256: 12b9d4fae5281db3f2752b976ed6b6cc71dafa32d8d61d5cef7a862412393464
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_DA8B5329_49DB_4C6C_923F_FEDFDFE8DDA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You disappoint me, dearest Mell."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mi deludi, caro Mell."

#: scenario:scenario_149349B0_AE96_4EFA_889E_E106147B1CB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 259099f4514c01bbcd45fd2cd40cd07b3e61c20586844ee7264a58a9892cc8f5
#. default-sha256: d0033eb55446ba80764abdacc9fb6ade931e8ebe807bc27031aba252d9eb99f0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_149349B0_AE96_4EFA_889E_E106147B1CB6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Er?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eh?"

#: scenario:scenario_68B11AA6_DD4F_4AF3_93EE_E20CEE066B19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85c53ac94f2621ea2273c4a058a1ad8d27661d6a7d3b3a796979d5aceb7e4f51
#. default-sha256: 26c02801dbdc4e834fed1754a071b3871a381093bc59a5925c68d6b796351ba7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_68B11AA6_DD4F_4AF3_93EE_E20CEE066B19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What do you ⟪k:2⟫think⟪k:3⟫ is the matter?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫They just keep ⟪k:6⟫coming⟪k:7⟫. "
"It never ⟪k:8⟫ends⟪k:9⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Qual è il problema, ⟪k:2⟫secondo te⟪k:3⟫?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Continuano ad arrivare⟪k:7⟫. "
"Non finiscono mai."

#: scenario:scenario_1AB4B92C_FA3A_45DE_9E53_EC773E8EE5DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d34874b6956cb092511d64a176c65f1bbb2c7600804133f4258e97b4fc07a046
#. default-sha256: 280b4458b145ae0e676dd6d19de5dc9046ccf2dc26a1a1919172dc9db7afdb99
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1AB4B92C_FA3A_45DE_9E53_EC773E8EE5DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’s driving me up the wall.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Everyone’s just repeating the same lines they’ve "
"been taught.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫They all think pretty jewels and requests to dance are enough to make a "
"girl swoon."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mi stanno facendo impazzire.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non fanno altro che ripetere le frasi che gli "
"sono state insegnate.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Pensano tutti che gioielli e inviti a ballare siano sufficienti a "
"far cadere una ragazza ai loro piedi."

#: scenario:scenario_C20CD433_B0CD_417B_B181_C24666F35234
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 926c6b0bf6607d783b2ed2938e2af08c7cb7b60c7ec2177ece43a5657bf25f1e
#. default-sha256: f09a0bb6be37574e04e7986ca01bb352a7bc0062ca9ec3cfad732b644e8fbc72
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C20CD433_B0CD_417B_B181_C24666F35234"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(But I think that ⟪k:2⟫is⟪k:3⟫ true for you, Nellie.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Sai, penso che per te sia davvero così, Nellie.)"

#: scenario:scenario_BA226F13_9347_408F_AC5B_C26B4A5BDFB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d6c0a2745809f764a029ea42bd627bf89dd79d6059e86cf66a96cabdecb532d
#. default-sha256: 24e179f951fc20f6e6c9a3b45f6daaef14950a1079237032bd5096d4e8ee0acc
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BA226F13_9347_408F_AC5B_C26B4A5BDFB0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Though... ⟪k:2⟫why is she disappointed with me?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(Ad ogni modo... ⟪k:2⟫perché se la prende con me?)"

#: scenario:scenario_4E973416_1EE7_46FA_86CD_CB839058D2EE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2565e8f3f7ad210df2a6ff0d76f524342adcb1defb92bd87102176e2c6564d71
#. default-sha256: b1eac882156f7561f77c1aa957608019685a38c8e565538d91c3030c85ce0426
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4E973416_1EE7_46FA_86CD_CB839058D2EE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Uggggh, I think I’m done with birthday parties after this year."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hahhh, ho chiuso con le feste di compleanno, dopo quest’anno."

#: scenario:scenario_F4C7CEBA_FFC0_4989_80F1_0B18359A4581
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bfefd67b4bc54d939c765802ec82485bbb07b8dce2dafc9374aebc2f560ef3e
#. default-sha256: 325b73f4872b7cd142f90530dac821ccd0fa24b6f821420dcea11269ff4f9857
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F4C7CEBA_FFC0_4989_80F1_0B18359A4581"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫They’ll probably throw an even bigger one next year."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Probabilmente ne organizzeranno una ancora più grande l’anno prossimo."

#: scenario:scenario_CD0AD072_93C9_4C07_88DF_F34C115B1CF6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 331ea8a60b70cca42d14ab549ed6ef39edc3d4a3184d495f9b019b03a25ae722
