msgctxt "scenario:scenario_95405DAD_48F4_4D56_9E62_07306CB18DAD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, jeez, how did I get myself into this?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh Gesù, come ci sono arrivato a questo punto?"

#: scenario:scenario_CF203C0A_1FA5_403E_A224_1159518A90E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67718f4838ea4de5cab67dbbbb0e9abec93cc6de1555145b7330ff2357e1c966
#. default-sha256: 2510d68cd6d38c9ba57ce03211c5544cbd2dfc31f936eca76f95488d1f16e3a5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CF203C0A_1FA5_403E_A224_1159518A90E4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nellie’s skirt fluttered along with her as she stepped in time to the music. ⟪k:3⟫"
"She was not only a skilled singer, but a skilled dancer as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La gonna di Nellie svolazzava insieme a lei mentre si muoveva a tempo di musica. "
"⟪k:3⟫Non era soltanto una brava cantante, ma anche un’ottima ballerina."

#: scenario:scenario_0FE7527D_9FFD_42C4_B949_FB69FE44D819
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ebcbbc0c38f823a1c831b0ad057d61f0de3157592496f80caf7f9aee2f53bef
#. default-sha256: 2d62cd42b453e7c5bb1dfa559e817b3a40f6646306fb29881774b59212d97476
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0FE7527D_9FFD_42C4_B949_FB69FE44D819"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mell, on the other hand, fumbled over his own feet trying to keep up. ⟪k:1⟫One would be hard-"
"pressed to describe his dance abilities as “good,” even as flattery."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mell, invece, calpestava i suoi stessi piedi cercando di tenere il passo. ⟪k:1⟫Chiunque "
"farebbe fatica a ritenere “buone” le sue abilità di ballo,⟪k:2⟫anche solo come lusinga."

#: scenario:scenario_2F0D3F6C_E102_4BAC_BC8F_248411697685
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05d956d299f0f3422b8da8df86be560320ebb4df60210584b83d90b67e37d4e7
#. default-sha256: 64a5e00ff25e91cefd4392ee2d804d7524eecad97c3abd3908c9e3ef1fcb5ed4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2F0D3F6C_E102_4BAC_BC8F_248411697685"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though boys of his pedigree were taught to dance as part of their etiquette lessons, he "
"found himself more being dragged around by his sister. ⟪k:1⟫He could hardly be said to be "
"“attending” to her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonostante ai ragazzi come lui venisse normalmente insegnato a ballare, come parte delle "
"lezioni di galateo, in quel momento si ritrovò più che altro ⟪k:1⟫trascinato⟪k:2⟫ da sua sorella. "
"⟪k:3⟫Non si poteva certo dire che fosse lui a “dirigere”."

#: scenario:scenario_E0CF0A52_ED46_405C_A60C_E2266E048503
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d5bddb4923f8843b336c96e106c1524a0652426003c484b8d52d8b48e825f0e
