msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫(Th-⟪k:4⟫This is humiliating!)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫(...Questo sì che è umiliante!)"

#: scenario:scenario_1793C260_8672_4F68_8AF1_A79776213C40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57592e9836615935a842157d76597cfa6a2c4fc4019bff4cd046cd00324ae109
#. default-sha256: 72c80789a9e65eed2cd9172f0042e31642a97afbaf9c598efa0772eead20a47a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1793C260_8672_4F68_8AF1_A79776213C40"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Because his parents had been hands-off in raising him, largely giving him free rein to "
"study and learn what he pleased, Mell looked like a tangled-up marionette."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I suoi genitori l’avevano cresciuto dandogli libera scelta su cosa studiare e imparare, "
"e per questo, in una circostanza simile, Mell sembrava una marionetta aggrovigliata."

#: scenario:scenario_B38D3DDA_0AD6_4373_87C9_4FF4EB6C9C48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e37a41aaf52f721ab792c62a1f30d94a3f2a577439cdca2fe5227ad0914dd91
#. default-sha256: 28c5355cc2e29ee434e5f74ed5e74992fca6e91b07fe015d275ce2d37a0390d2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B38D3DDA_0AD6_4373_87C9_4FF4EB6C9C48"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫From throughout the hall, he could hear giggling, uncomfortable chuckling, and people "
"coughing to disguise their laughter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Poteva sentire gli ospiti ridacchiare e sghignazzare,⟪k:1⟫e addirittura persone che "
"tossivano per mascherare le risate."

#: scenario:scenario_278D5AED_96DC_439B_9E27_53B3FEE972A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fcac3739b0be60abdde601fd1297f691bfbf56c8e9ec302b8c0242e03b2a4e21
#. default-sha256: 1d378dd707060460f64aba7b56da75a0d6f3e423111e85068d588dc21c8346b3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_278D5AED_96DC_439B_9E27_53B3FEE972A0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Come now, dearest Mell. ⟪k:3⟫If this is the best you can manage, what are you "
"going to do when you find a girl that catches your eye?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Suvvia, caro Mell.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Se è questo il meglio che sai fare, cosa farai quando "
"troverai una ragazza che catturerà il tuo sguardo?"

#: scenario:scenario_5DB8D4D2_F7CE_4E22_BDC3_40E6A05FBCA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 999cec7f6e13391e96eda5700fb6bb2b37288569269ef0a3515703a074e5ca04
