msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I won’t, so it doesn’t matter!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non succederà, quindi non ha importanza!"

