msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5636F3C0_A975_4B03_9F50_64CDF5CD4308"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nellie alone enjoyed her time dancing with her brother—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫and quite thoroughly, "
"at that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Solo Nellie si divertiva ballando con suo fratello—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫e anche tanto."

#: scenario:scenario_328DB8FA_B8B2_403D_B8D5_D807A430EC74
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2fa25fed628941ad85a6038c3643dc856931a4f5479607c26792ac9ab764929f
