msgctxt "scenario:scenario_328DB8FA_B8B2_403D_B8D5_D807A430EC74"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It did not matter to her that he moved awkwardly or that the guests were giving them cold "
"stares."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non le importava che lui si muovesse goffamente o che gli ospiti stessero lanciando loro "
"gelide occhiate."

#: scenario:scenario_1022B43D_89F4_4E23_9DFF_6AC8D77C07F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26c153b2bf1886c0a865b7aff7945680fae8cd242b75a95387cf9884edbc8226
