msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1022B43D_89F4_4E23_9DFF_6AC8D77C07F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was their parents who first cracked under the pressure. ⟪k:1⟫Just as their father was "
"about to give an exaggerated cough and stop the music,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Furono i loro genitori i primi a sentirsi sotto pressione.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ma proprio quando loro "
"padre stava per tossire con forza, intenzionato a fermare la musica,"

#: scenario:scenario_3E8D6581_2AC5_40CC_B70F_3AFCC0A501D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6f5142569f1938d0131c4354068b7b28ea8f44591ce761378e64977c1f626a6
