msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a ruckus suddenly swelled up near the entrance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫d’un tratto, si generò un trambusto vicino all’ingresso della villa."

