msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The music came to a stop, and the party guests began bustling. ⟪k:3⟫The siblings’ "
"father spoke up sternly above the noise in order to quell the spreading commotion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La musica si fermò e gli ospiti della festa iniziarono ad agitarsi.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Il "
"padre dei fratelli dovette parlare molto al di sopra del rumore⟪k:5⟫per contenere la confusione."

#: scenario:scenario_287512F0_CF6F_4350_BE3A_A53B0D268FEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9f17825d3fbae84a4a845f398509a0b678749c765d6134dafa25e7f17f41a38
#. default-sha256: 53d9bdc41e649f873c416c56e8ee4f3be7c7883a6fa8713257ac0f9294e90e0b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_287512F0_CF6F_4350_BE3A_A53B0D268FEB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He ordered the servants to investigate, had the music restarted, gave a short apology for "
"the interruption, and set the party back on course."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ordinò ai servi di indagare, fece ripartire la musica,⟪k:1⟫si scusò brevemente per "
"l’interruzione e fece riprendere la festa."

#: scenario:scenario_E9C09BAB_174B_4898_8822_042911CEB06C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
