msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I went to go check on the entrance with the other servants, as I recall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Andai a controllare all’ingresso con gli altri servi, da quel che ricordo."

#: scenario:scenario_38593193_FEAF_4CE1_BB4E_72200E3E8348
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
